      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "For the dressing: Whisk together all ingredients in a medium bowl. Set aside.",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "primary_message": "For the Salad: In a large pot of salted boiling water, cook pasta until very tender, about 15 minutes. Drain pasta and transfer to a large bowl. Add vinegar and stir until completely absorbed. Let pasta stand until cool, about 10 minutes.",
